ndefined",["$","p",null,{"style":{"margin":0,"color":"var(--fg-soft)"},"children":"很多人把\"看不清红色绿色\"统称为色盲，但在医学上，色盲（anopia）与色弱（anomaly）并不相同。前者是某一类视锥细胞完全缺失，后者则是细胞仍在但功能减弱、敏感度下降。"}]]}],["$","section","1",{"className":"stack","style":{"gap":"var(--s-2)"},"children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"margin":0,"fontSize":"1.2rem"},"children":"三色视觉的底层逻辑"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"margin":0,"color":"var(--fg-soft)"},"children":"人眼视网膜上主要有三种视锥细胞，分别对不同波长敏感，大致对应红、绿、蓝。正常色觉（三色视觉）依靠三者配合分辨 millions 种颜色；当其中一类缺失或减弱，可辨颜色数量便会大幅缩水。"}]]}],["$","section","2",{"className":"stack","style":{"gap":"var(--s-2)"},"children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"margin":0,"fontSize":"1.2rem"},"children":"对生活的影响"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"margin":0,"color":"var(--fg-soft)"},"children":"色弱往往只是某些相近色（如深红与深绿、橙与棕）难以区分，多数职业不受影响；色盲的辨识缺口更大，可能在交通信号、地图、图表等场景需要额外辅助。"}]]}],["$","section","3",{"className":"stack","style":{"gap":"var(--s-2)"},"children":["$undefined",["$","p",null,{"style":{"margin":0,"color":"var(--fg-soft)"},"children":"在线筛查能大致判断是否存在异常以及偏向红绿还是蓝黄，但无法精确区分\"盲\"与\"弱\"，确诊仍需专业仪器。"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"card row between","style":{"gap":"var(--s-3)","flexWrap":"wrap"},"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"muted","style":{"fontSize":"0.9rem"},"children":"下一篇"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/learn/ishihara-principle","className":"row","style":{"gap":6,"fontWeight":600},"children":["石原氏检测图是怎么\"骗过\"眼睛的"," ",["$","svg",null,{"width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":1.8,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"$undefined","style":"$undefined","aria-hidden":"true","children":"$3"}]]}]]}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/test","className":"btn btn-primary btn-block","style":{"maxWidth":320,"marginInline":"auto"},"children":["现在做一次检测 ",["$","svg",null,{"width":18,"height":18,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":1.8,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"$undefined","style":"$undefin